  23:common/prog/dbus/dbusdll.c ****  *               TargetAddress, MessageIdentifier, the data of the message and the attached CRC (16
  24:common/prog/dbus/dbusdll.c ****  *               all followed by an acknowledgement from the receiving node (or sending node by bro
  25:common/prog/dbus/dbusdll.c ****  *     
